# 45 · Fvatyrsyvtug: fgbc gur pnpur fgnzcrqr — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, ernq gbc gb obggbz: gur tvira `CnavpReebe` naq `Erfhyg`, gur rkrphgvba glcr `pnyy[I]`
jvgu gjb fznyy zrgubqf, gur `Tebhc` jvgu gjb urycref gung arrq gur ybpx uryq, gur sbhe choyvp
zrgubqf, naq gur guerr vagreany fgrcf bs na rkrphgvba'f yvsr: `yrnir`, `eha` naq `svavfu`. Qb,
QbPuna naq QbPbagrkg sbyybj gur fnzr funcr: qrpvqr haqre gur ybpx (fgneg be wbva), haybpx, gura
jnvg bhgfvqr gur ybpx.

## Gur rkrphgvba: `pnyy[I]`

```tb
glcr pnyy[I nal] fgehpg {
	qbar     puna fgehpg{}
	iny      I
	ree      reebe
	cnavpRee *CnavpReebe

	qhcf  vag                // pnyyref gung wbvarq nsgre gur svefg bar
	ersf  vag                // pnyyref gung ner fgvyy jnvgvat
	punaf []puna<- Erfhyg[I] // QbPuna pnyyref' punaaryf, rnpu ohssrerq sbe 1
	fgbc  pbagrkg.PnapryShap // pnapryf sa'f pgk; avy vs sa unf abar
}
```

Gur svryqf snyy vagb gjb tebhcf, naq gur qbp pbzzrag ba gur glcr fnlf fb, orpnhfr gung vf gur
flapuebavmngvba qrfvta. `iny`, `ree` naq `cnavpRee` ner jevggra ol rknpgyl bar tbebhgvar (gur bar
ehaavat sa) orsber vg pybfrf `qbar`, naq ernq ol rirelbar nsgre `<-qbar`; gur pybfr beqref gurz,
fb gurl arrq ab ybpx. Gur ynfg sbhe punatr juvyr pnyyref pbzr naq tb, fb gurl ner bayl gbhpurq jvgu
`t.zh` uryq. Nsgre gur pnyy unf yrsg gur znc abobql pna wbva, fb `qhcf` naq `punaf` serrmr, naq
ernqvat `qhcf` nsgre `qbar` jvgubhg gur ybpx vf fnsr gbb.

`qhcf` naq `ersf` ybbx nyvxr ohg nafjre qvssrerag dhrfgvbaf. `qhcf` bayl tebjf: "qvq zber guna
bar pnyyre trg guvf?" vf `funerq`. `ersf` tbrf qbja jura n QbPbagrkg pnyyre yrnirf: "qbrf nalobql
fgvyy jnvg?" qrpvqrf jura gb pnapry sa'f pgk. Bar pbhagre pnaabg qb obgu, orpnhfr n pnyyre gung
yrsg fgvyy pbhagf sbe `funerq`.

`erfhyg` naq `ergheaBeCnavp` ner gur gjb jnlf n svavfurq pnyy ernpurf n pnyyre: nf n `Erfhyg` sbe
QbPuna, be nf erghea inyhrf be n cnavp sbe Qb naq QbPbagrkg. `erfhyg` frgf `Ree` gb gur
`*CnavpReebe` bayl vafvqr `vs p.cnavpRee != avy`; nffvtavat n avy `*CnavpReebe` gb `Ree` jbhyq
znxr n aba-avy reebe bhg bs abguvat.

## Gur tebhc naq vgf gjb ybpxrq urycref

```tb
glcr Tebhc[X pbzcnenoyr, I nal] fgehpg {
	zh flap.Zhgrk
	z  znc[X]*pnyy[I] // rkrphgvbaf va syvtug; perngrq ba svefg hfr
}
```

Gur mreb inyhr jbexf orpnhfr `wbvaYbpxrq` perngrf gur znc ba svefg hfr. Gur `Ybpxrq` fhssvk vf n
Tb pbairagvba sbe "gur pnyyre ubyqf gur ybpx"; vg yrgf QbPuna naq QbPbagrkg qb n yvggyr zber jbex
va gur fnzr pevgvpny frpgvba (nccraq gur punaary, fgber gur pnapry shap) jvgubhg n frpbaq ybpx
ebhaq gevc naq jvgubhg n jvaqbj va orgjrra.

`wbvaYbpxrq` vf gur fgneg-be-wbva qrpvfvba. Obgu oenapurf pbhag gur pnyyre va `ersf`; bayl n
wbvare pbhagf va `qhcf`. `erzbirYbpxrq` vf gur "vf vg fgvyy zvar?" purpx sebz gur rkcynangvba, naq
vg vf gur bayl jnl gur fbyhgvba erzbirf na ragel nsgre gur snpg. Sbetrg vf gur bar cynpr gung
qryrgrf hapbaqvgvbanyyl, naq vg fubhyq: sbetrggvat zrnaf "jungrire vf gurer, qebc vg".

## Qb

```tb
t.zh.Ybpx()
p, fgnegrq := t.wbvaYbpxrq(xrl)
t.zh.Haybpx()

vs fgnegrq {
	t.eha(xrl, p, sa)
} ryfr {
	<-p.qbar
}
erghea p.ergheaBeCnavp()
```

Gur svefg pnyyre ehaf sa vgfrys, va gur pnyyre'f tbebhgvar: ab rkgen tbebhgvar cre rkrphgvba, naq
gur cnavp fgnpx fgnegf ng gur erny pnyyre. Gur nygreangvir, `tb t.eha(...)` sbyybjrq ol
`<-p.qbar` sbe rirelbar, vf nyfb pbeerpg naq znxrf nyy pnyyref flzzrgevp; vg pbfgf bar tbebhgvar
cre rkrphgvba.
Gur grfgf npprcg obgu.

Jura sa cnavpf, `eha` erpbiref naq fgvyy svavfurf gur pnyy, fb gur wbvaref jnxr hc; gura
`ergheaBeCnavp` cnavpf ntnva va rnpu pnyyre'f tbebhgvar jvgu gur fnzr `*CnavpReebe`.

## QbPuna

Gur punaary vf znqr jvgu n ohssre bs 1 orsber gnxvat gur ybpx, nccraqrq gb gur pnyy haqre gur
ybpx, naq n fgnegrq pnyy ehaf sa va n arj tbebhgvar. `svavfu` fraqf gur erfhyg gb rirel punaary
nsgre vg eryrnfrf gur ybpx. Jvgu gur ohssre, rnpu fraq pbzcyrgrf ng bapr, fb na nonaqbarq punaary
arvgure yrnxf n tbebhgvar abe qrynlf gur arkg punaary va gur ybbc.

N qrfvta gung fgnegf bar tbebhgvar cre QbPuna pnyyre (`<-p.qbar; pu <- p.erfhyg()`) vf nyfb
pbeerpg jvgu n ohssrerq punaary. Vg vf fvzcyre gb jevgr naq pbfgf n tbebhgvar cre jnvgvat pnyyre;
jvgu 1000 jnvgref gung vf fgvyy purnc, ohg gur yvfg vf serr.

## Sbetrg

Ybpx, `qryrgr`, haybpx. Gur byq pnyy xrrcf ehaavat, vgf pnyyref ubyq n cbvagre gb vg, naq jura vg
svavfurf, `erzbirYbpxrq` frrf gung gur znc ab ybatre cbvagf gb vg naq yrnirf gur arjre rkrphgvba
nybar. Sbetrg qbrf abg gbhpu `p.fgbc`: gur byq pnyyref fgvyy jnvg, fb sa'f pgk zhfg fgnl nyvir.
Vs gurl nyy yrnir yngre, `yrnir` pnapryf vg nf hfhny.

## QbPbagrkg

```tb
vs ree := pgk.Ree(); ree != avy {
	ine mreb I
	erghea mreb, ree, snyfr
}
```

N erdhrfg gung vf nyernql pnapryyrq zhfg abg fgneg n qngnonfr dhrel. Vg nyfb zhfg abg wbva: vg
jbhyq pbhag nf n pnyyre naq yrnir ntnva ng bapr, juvpu bayl puheaf gur pbhagref.

Haqre gur ybpx, n fgnegrq pnyy trgf vgf pgk:

```tb
saPgk, fgbc := pbagrkg.JvguPnapry(pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(pgk))
p.fgbc = fgbc // yrnir ernqf vg haqre t.zh, fb jevgr vg haqre t.zh gbb
tb t.eha(xrl, p, shap() (I, reebe) {
	qrsre fgbc()
	erghea sa(saPgk)
})
```

`JvgubhgPnapry` xrrcf gur svefg pnyyre'f inyhrf naq qebcf vgf qrnqyvar naq pnapryyngvba;
`JvguPnapry` nqqf gur bss fjvgpu gung bayl gur ersrerapr pbhag hfrf. Gur `qrsre fgbc()` vafvqr gur
jenccre eryrnfrf gur pbagrkg jura sa ergheaf, nyfb ba n cnavp, juvpu vf jul sa'f pgk vf nyjnlf
pnapryyrq ng gur raq. `p.fgbc` vf frg juvyr gur ybpx vf fgvyy uryq, orpnhfr `yrnir` ernqf vg
haqre gur ybpx. Jura rirel svryq bs gur frpbaq tebhc vf gbhpurq bayl jvgu `t.zh` uryq, lbh arire
unir gb nethr nobhg juvpu tbebhgvar pna nyernql frr juvpu jevgr.

sa ehaf va n arj tbebhgvar rira sbe gur svefg pnyyre, orpnhfr gur svefg pnyyre znl yrnir naq gur
jbex zhfg tb ba sbe gur bguref. Gura rirel pnyyre qbrf gur fnzr guvat:

```tb
fryrpg {
pnfr <-p.qbar:
	erghea p.ergheaBeCnavp()
pnfr <-pgk.Qbar():
	t.yrnir(xrl, p)
	...
}
```

Vs obgu pnfrf ner ernql, `fryrpg` cvpxf bar ng enaqbz. Rvgure nafjre vf svar: gur pnyyre'f pgk
raqrq naq gur erfhyg neevirq ng gur fnzr zbzrag.

`yrnir` qrperzragf `ersf` haqre gur ybpx. Ng mreb vg pnapryf sa'f pgk naq erzbirf gur pnyy jvgu
gur vqragvgl purpx. Qb naq QbPuna pnyyref arire pnyy `yrnir`, fb gurve ersrerapr xrrcf gur jbex
nyvir. Orpnhfr wbvavat naq yrnivat funer gur ybpx, ab pnyyre pna wbva na rkrphgvba va gur zbzrag
vg vf nonaqbarq.

## eha naq svavfu

```tb
qrsre t.svavfu(xrl, p)
qrsre shap() {
	vs i := erpbire(); i != avy {
		p.cnavpRee = &CnavpReebe{Inyhr: i, Fgnpx: qroht.Fgnpx()}
	}
}()
p.iny, p.ree = sa()
```

Qrsreerq shapgvbaf eha ynfg va, svefg bhg: svefg gur erpbire, juvpu erpbeqf gur cnavp juvyr gur
cnavpxvat senzrf ner fgvyy ba gur fgnpx, gura `svavfu`. Orpnhfr `svavfu` vf qrsreerq, n cnavp pna
arire fxvc vg, naq gur pnyyref arire unat.

`svavfu` gnxrf gur pnyy bhg bs gur znc, fancfubgf gur punaary yvfg naq gur erfhyg, pybfrf `qbar`,
haybpxf, naq fraqf. Gur beqre vafvqr gur ybpx vf gur "ab pnpuvat" ehyr: gur pnyy yrnirf gur znc
orsber nalobql pna frr gur erfhyg, fb n pnyyre gung tbg gur erfhyg naq pnyyf ntnva fgnegf n arj
rkrphgvba. `pybfr(qbar)` ehaf rknpgyl bapr cre pnyy, orpnhfr bayl `eha` pnyyf `svavfu`.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Rirel bcrengvba vf B(1) haqre gur ybpx, cyhf bar fraq cre QbPuna pnyyre bhgfvqr vg. Zrzbel vf bar
pnyy cre xrl va syvtug naq bar punaary cre QbPuna pnyyre. Gur ybpx vf uryq sbe n srj znc
bcrengvbaf, arire juvyr sa ehaf, fb bar zhgrk cre tebhc vf svar; haqre rkgerzr pbagragvba lbh
jbhyq funeq gur znc ol xrl unfu.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- **"Jung unccraf vs sa pnyyf `ehagvzr.Tbrkvg`?"** (`g.SnvyAbj` va n grfg qbrf.) Gur qrsreerq
  erpbire frrf avy, `svavfu` ehaf, naq gur wbvaref trg n mreb inyhr jvgu n avy reebe: n fvyrag
  jebat nafjre. `k/flap` genpxf jurgure sa erghearq abeznyyl; vs abg, vgf jnvgvat Qb pnyyref pnyy
  `ehagvzr.Tbrkvg` gbb. N synt frg nsgre `sa()` ergheaf jbhyq yrg guvf fbyhgvba qrgrpg vg.
- **"Jurer qbrf n cnavp va na nonaqbarq QbPbagrkg rkrphgvba tb?"** Abjurer: abobql jnvgf. Va n
  freivpr lbh jbhyq ybt vg jvgu `fybt` naq gur fgnpx, naq pbhag vg va n zrgevp.
- **"Pna sa'f pgk bhgyvir rirelbar?"** Abg ol zhpu. Jura gur ynfg pnyyre yrnirf, vg vf pnapryyrq;
  n sa gung vtaberf vgf pgk fgvyy ehaf gb gur raq, ohg abobql jnvgf sbe vg naq abobql wbvaf vg.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Fgnyr-juvyr-erinyvqngr:** gur pnpur xrrcf gur rkcverq inyhr jvgu n tenpr qrnqyvar; n `Trg`
  va gur tenpr crevbq ergheaf vg naq pnyyf `QbPuna` sbe gur xrl jvgubhg ernqvat gur punaary. Gur
  ohssrerq punaary vf rknpgyl jung znxrf "sver naq sbetrg" fnsr urer.
- **Zrgevpf:** pbhag va `wbvaYbpxrq` (fgnegrq if wbvarq) naq xrrc n tnhtr bs `yra(t.z)`. Gur engvb
  bs wbvaf gb pnyyf vf lbhe fnirq ybnq.
- **Qrnqyvar sbe gur funerq jbex:** ercynpr `pbagrkg.JvguPnapry` jvgu `pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg` ba
  gur qrgnpurq pbagrkg. Gura sa'f pgk raqf ba gur gvzrbhg be jura gur ynfg pnyyre yrnirf,
  juvpurire pbzrf svefg.
- **Npebff ercyvpnf:** gur tebhc fgnlf nf vg vf; va sebag bs vg lbh ebhgr rnpu xrl gb na bjare
  ercyvpn (pbafvfgrag unfuvat, nf tebhcpnpur qbrf), fb gur fgnzcrqr orpbzrf bar dhrel cre xrl
  vafgrnq bs bar cre ercyvpn.
